@startuml j7-clinic-file-edit
!include style.iuml
title J7 Editing the clinic file
actor Staff
participant "Staff page\n(staff/staff.js, staff/form.js,\nshared.js)" as SP
participant "Rules engine\n(core.js)" as Core
participant "api/clinic.js" as Clinic
database "Store (Postgres)\nthrough api/_store.js" as Store
participant "Patient chat on any device\n(chat.js, shared.js)" as Chat
actor Patient
autonumber

Staff -> SP : changes a value under "Edit with a form" or in the JSON box,\nthen presses "Save clinic file"
SP -> Core : FD.validateClinic, then FD.saveClinic
Core --> SP : the file is in use in the staff browser
SP -> Clinic : shared.js: POST /api/clinic (the file, with the desk code)
Clinic -> Clinic : checks the desk code, then the shape of the file
Clinic -> Store : the one row of the table clinic_data
Clinic --> SP : 200
SP --> Staff : "Saved for every device. The chat answers from this file from the very next question."
Patient -> Chat : asks a question
Chat -> Clinic : shared.js: GET /api/clinic (the answer waits two seconds at most)
Clinic -> Store : read the saved file
Clinic --> Chat : the saved file
Chat -> Core : FD.saveClinic, then FD.answer from the new file
Chat --> Patient : the answer holds the new value
Staff -> SP : presses "Use the original file"
SP -> Clinic : shared.js: POST /api/clinic (reset, with the desk code)
Clinic -> Store : the saved row is deleted
SP --> Staff : "Back to the original clinic file, on every device."
@enduml
